      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY ULTIMATE RUDI (7) turned in a strong effort last start when he led and battled on well but just missed out at this track over 1790m. Gets a soft run on the inside of the second line but may need luck at some point. Good enough to win a race of this calibre. DIAMOND KRUSHER (3) was in the money two runs ago then was about the mark again last time over 1790m at this track, finishing 7 metres from the winner in third. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Taking on a better field but she is good enough to take this out. SUNSHINE WARRIOR (9) is on the radar after his last-start fourth over 1790m at this track nine days ago. BOHEMIAN BRAIDS (2) is worth some thought based on his second over 1790m at this track two runs ago.",
